msgstr "在服务端终止（需要推送证书）"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "测试"

msgid "Testing credentials"
msgstr "正在测试凭据"

msgid "The LAN host running the service."
msgstr "运行该服务的内网主机。"

msgid "The account needs a name."
msgstr "账号必须有名称。"

msgid "The address is answered directly, which is what a tunnel needs."
msgstr "直接返回该地址,这正是隧道所需要的。"

msgid "The authority requires one, and uses it for expiry warnings."
msgstr "证书颁发机构要求填写，并用于到期提醒。"

msgid "The certificate was issued."
msgstr "证书已签发。"

msgid "The daemon writes to syslog through procd."
msgstr "守护进程通过 procd 写入 syslog。"

msgid "The first server"
msgstr "第一台服务器"

msgid "The port the server will listen on for this router."
msgstr "服务端为本路由器监听的端口。"

msgid "The shared secret the server was configured with."
msgstr "服务端配置的共享密钥。"

msgid "This account manages no zones."
msgstr "该账号下没有域名。"

msgid "This takes a few minutes: the authority has to see the DNS record propagate before it will issue."
msgstr "这需要几分钟：证书颁发机构必须先看到 DNS 记录生效才会签发。"

msgid "This zone has no records."
msgstr "该域名下没有解析记录。"

msgid "Token"
